hadiths[17]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1376","Muawiya (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah jis shakhs ke sath bhalai ka irada farmata hai usey deen ki samajh ata farmata hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1377","Ibn Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Rashk (hasad) sirf do (qism ke aadmiyon) par jaez hai: aik wo shakhs jisey Allah ne maal diya phir usey haq ke rastey mein kharch karne par laga diya, aur aik wo shakhs jisey Allah ne hikmat (deen ka ilm) ata ki to wo uske mutabiq faisla karta hai aur usey sikhata hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1378","Abu Musa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Us hidayat aur ilm ki misaal jis ke sath Allah ne mujhey bheja hai, us barish ki si hai jo zameen par barsi, to us mein se kuchh zameen achchhi thi jis ne pani qabool kya phir us ne ghass aur bahut sa chara ugaya, aur us mein se kuchh sakht zameen thi jis ne pani rok liya, to Allah ne us se logon ko faeda pahunchaya, to unhon-ne us se piya aur pilaya aur kheti ki, aur us mein se kuchh hissey par barish aisi zameen par padi jo chatyal maidan thi jo na pani rokti hai aur na ghass ugati hai, to ye us shakhs ki misaal hai jis ne Allah ke deen mein samajh hasil ki aur usey wo faeda diya jis ke sath Allah ne mujhey bheja aur us ne ilm hasil kya, aur us shakhs ki misaal hai jis ne iski taraf sar uthakar na dekha aur Allah ki hidayat ko qabool na kya jis ke sath main bheja gaya hun. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1379","Sehel bin Saad (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Ali (Raziallahu anhu) se farmaya: Allah ki qasam! Agar Allah tumharey zariye aik aadmi ko bhi hidayat de dey to ye tumharey liye surkh oonton se behtar hai. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
"1380","Abdullah bin Amr bin Al-Aas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Meri taraf se pahunchayo chaahey aik aayat hi ho, aur Bani Israeel se bayan karo is mein koi harj nahi, aur jo shakhs mujh par jaan-boojh kar jhoot boley wo apna thikana dozakh mein bana ley. Ise Bukhari ne riwayat kya hai."
"1381","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo shakhs aisa rasta chalta hai jis mein wo ilm talaash karta hai to Allah uske liye uske zariye Jannat ka rasta aasaan kar deta hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1382","Unhin se (Raziallahu anhu) riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo shakhs hidayat ki taraf bulata hai uske liye uski pairwi karne walon ke ajr ke barabar ajr hai, is se unke ajron mein kuchh kami nahi hoti. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1383","Unhin se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab aadmi ka beta mar jata hai to uska amal munqata ho jata hai siwaey teen chizon ke: sadqa jariya, ya aisa ilm jis se faeda uthaya jaey, ya naik beta jo uske liye dua karta hai. Ise Muslim ne riwayat kya hai."
"1384","Unhin se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Duniya maloon hai aur jo kuchh is mein hai wo bhi maloon hai siwaey Allah Taala ke zikr ke aur us chiz ke jo us se judi ho, aur alim aur ilm seekhne waley ke. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai."
"1385","Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo shakhs ilm ki talab mein nikla wo wapas aaney tak Allah ke rastey mein hai. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai."
"1386","Abu Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Momin bhalai se kabhi sair nahi hota yahan tak ke uska anjaam Jannat hota hai. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai."
"1387","Abu Umama (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Alim ki fazilat aabid par aisi hai jaisi meri fazilat tum mein se adna shakhs par hai. Phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Allah aur uske farishtey aur aasmanon aur zameen waley yahan tak ke cheonti apne bil mein aur machhli bhi logon ko bhalai sikhane walon par rehmat bhejtey hain. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai."
"1388","Abud Darda (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Jo shakhs aisa rasta chalta hai jis mein wo ilm talaash karta hai to Allah uske liye Jannat ka rasta aasaan kar deta hai, aur beshak farishtey taalibe-ilm ke liye uske amal se khush hokar apne par bichha detey hain, aur beshak alim ke liye aasmanon aur zameen ki tamam makhlooq yahan tak ke pani mein machhliyan bhi maghfirat ki dua karti hain, aur alim ki fazilat aabid par aisi hai jaisi chaand ki fazilat baqi sitaaron par hai, aur beshak ulema ambiya ke waris hain aur beshak ambiya ne deenar aur dirham wirasat mein nahi chhorey balke unhon-ne ilm wirasat mein chhora hai, to jis ne usey liya us ne bara hissa liya. Ise Abu Dawud aur Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai."
"1389","Ibn Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Allah us shakhs ko taza dam rakhey jis ne ham se koi baat suni phir usey jaisa suna waisa hi pahunchaya, kyonke baaz auqaat jisey pahunchaya jata hai wo sunney waley se zyada yaad rakhne wala hota hai. Ise Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan sahih hadis hai."
"1390","Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jis shakhs se ilm ki baat poochhi gai phir us ne usey chhupaya to qayamat ke din usey aag ki lagam dalhi jaeygi. Ise Abu Dawud aur Tirmizi ne riwayat kya hai aur kaha: Hasan hadis hai."
"1391","Unhin se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo shakhs aisa ilm seekhta hai jis se Allah Azza wa Jall ki raza talab ki jati hai aur usey sirf isliye seekhta hai taake uske zariye duniya ki gharaz hasil karey to wo qayamat ke din Jannat ki khushbu bhi nahi paeyga. Ise Abu Dawud ne sahih sanad se riwayat kya hai."
"1392","Abdullah bin Amr bin Al-Aas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Beshak Allah ilm ko logon se is tarah nahi uthayega ke usey un se chheen ley balke ilm ko ulema ko uthaney se uthayega, yahan tak ke jab koi alim baqi nahi rahega to log jahil sardaron ko bana leingey, phir un se sawal kya jaeyga to wo baghair ilm ke fatwa deingey, phir khud gumrah hongey aur doosron ko gumrah kareingey. (Muttafaqun aleh)."
